[about]
Title=05 - Add, Inspect and Edit Records
Intro=Adding a record with its pick lists, looking at one record whole, and changing a value and checking what was saved.
Setup=JobTrail is open on the jobs table. This morning I found a support analyst opening at Widget Works.
Homework=Add a job of your own, inspect it, then change one field.

[step]

Say=Control plus N, New record -- N for New.
Key=Control+N
Hear=New Record dialog
Hear=Employer edit
Note=One box per field, in the order I would fill them in.

[step]

Say=The employer, then Tab to the title.
Key=Tab
Hear=Title edit

[step]

Say=The title, then Tab to status.
Key=Tab
Hear=Status edit
Hear=F4 picks from 7 values

[step]

Say=F4 opens the pick list. F4 picks, all through Homer programs.
Key=F4
Hear=Status list box, applied, 1 of 7

[step]

Say=Typing a letter jumps to the first value starting with it, so L reaches lead. That is L, Lima.
Key=l
Hear=lead, 4 of 7

[step]

Say=Enter takes it. Control plus Enter saves the record from anywhere in the dialog.
Key=Control+Enter
Hear=Records list view
Hear=Widget Works (your own entry) Support Analyst lead, 5 of 5

[step]

Say=A row speaks three fields. Control plus I, Inspect Record, reads them all.
Key=Control+I
Hear=Inspect Record dialog
Hear=employer: Example Widgets Company (sample employer)
Note=I for Inspect. A read-only window; Escape closes it.

[step]

Say=For one fact, I ask instead. Shift plus N, Say Notes.
Key=Escape
Hear=Records list view

[step]

Say=Shift plus N is Say Notes -- N for Notes -- and reads the whole note.
Key=Shift+N
Hear=notes, Illustrative record. Interview booked for the 24th; ask about screen reader testing tools.
Note=Shift plus T, Say Tags, and Shift plus U, Say URL, work the same way.

[step]

Say=Shift plus E, Say Edited: when I last changed it.
Key=Shift+E
Hear=edited, September 19, 2026 at 10:01 PM
Note=Shift plus A, Say Added, says when it arrived.

[step]

Say=Alt plus Shift plus N edits the notes in their own window, for a long one.
Key=Alt+Shift+N
Hear=Notes dialog
Hear=Notes edit, multiline, Illustrative record. Interview booked for the 24th.
Note=Control plus Enter saves; Escape leaves.

[step]

Say=Enter opens the record in the same dialog I used to add one.
Key=Enter
Hear=Edit Record dialog
Hear=Employer edit, Example Widgets Company (sample employer)

[step]

Say=Tab to status, F4 for the list, O for offer. That is O, Oscar.
Key=o
Hear=offer, 5 of 7

[step]

Say=Control plus Enter saves, the way it presses OK in any DbDo dialog.
Key=Control+Enter
Hear=Records list view
Hear=Example Widgets Company (sample employer) Accessibility Analyst offer, 2 of 4

[step]

Say=For one field, F2 edits the cell in place -- the same F2 that renames a file in Windows.
Key=F2
Hear=Cell edit, offer
Note=Enter saves the cell and keeps my place.

[step]

Say=Shift plus C checks it.
Key=Escape
Hear=Records list view

[step]

Say=Shift plus C is Say Cell: the column, where the row is, and the value.
Key=Shift+C
Hear=status
Hear=row 2 of 4
Hear=offer

[step]

Say=Control plus Shift plus C, Copy Record, duplicates the current row as a new one, for a job much like the last; then edit the few fields that differ.
Key=Control+Shift+C
Hear=Record copied

[step]

Say=Control plus D, Delete Record, removes the current record -- or every marked record when marks exist -- after asking once.
Key=Control+D
Hear=Delete this record? Yes button

[step]

Say=Escape keeps it. The question is the only confirmation DbDo asks; everything else is saved as you go.
Key=Escape
Hear=JobTrail jobs

[step]

Say=What this walk taught. I say the key; the reader says what it does.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Control plus N.
Key=
Hear=New Record

[step]

Say=F4.
Key=
Hear=Current Windows

[step]

Say=Control plus Enter.
Key=
Hear=Open Cell Value

[step]

Say=Control plus I.
Key=
Hear=Inspect Record
